/E (IIT Madras Zanzibar joined hands with the Comptroller and Auditor General of India \(CAG\) to host an international training programme on Data Science, Artificial Intelligence and Cyber Security Audit - the first of its kind organised outside India. Conceptualised by CAG of India and supported by the Ministry of External Affairs, Government of India, and the Office of the High Commissioner of India to Tanzania, the programme brought together senior audit professionals from Supreme Audit Institutions across Africa. IITM Pravartak Technologies Foundation coordinated the initiative.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
